  ],
  "quotes": [
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "And again, um I know probably some of you guys um uh do use Outlook, so if you um have not been able to receive that those materials, they are also on our IR website.",
    "anchor": "00:00:27",
    "who": "Mike",
    "title": "Mike",
    "seg": 1
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "Florian will then discuss our operational progress and expanding capabilities, uh followed by Felix, who will share his perspective on our strategic positioning and outlook.",
    "anchor": "00:00:59",
    "who": "Mike",
    "title": "Mike",
    "seg": 2
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "This outperformance continued during the first nine months of 2026, when SPE revenue grew 48% year on year.",
    "anchor": "00:05:01",
    "who": "Charles",
    "title": "Charles",
    "seg": 10
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "Felix will discuss the strategic implication in greater detail.",
    "anchor": "00:09:28",
    "who": "Charles",
    "title": "Charles",
    "seg": 19
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "We evaluate this investment against customer demand, execution requirement, and expect- expected returns, while maintaining strict discipline over working capital and operating expenses to protect cash and flexibility.",
    "anchor": "00:11:00",
    "who": "Charles",
    "title": "Charles",
    "seg": 22
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "As we approach 2027, our business is entering its next stage of development with a larger revenue base, broader capability to address customers' rising demand, and stronger operating leverage.",
    "anchor": "00:11:28",
    "who": "Charles",
    "title": "Charles",
    "seg": 23
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "At the same time, infrastructure investments will not progress in a straight line.",
    "anchor": "00:25:55",
    "who": "Felix",
    "title": "Felix",
    "seg": 48
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "The underlying demand for computing infrastructure remains compelling, but the timing and composition of investment will change along the way, with the potential of spec upgrades within the same platform.",
    "anchor": "00:26:24",
    "who": "Felix",
    "title": "Felix",
    "seg": 49
   }
  ],
